 "insight": [
  "The share of Luxembourg's exports that were computers decreased from 19.7% in 2005 to 0.8% in 2025.",
  "The largest share was 28.0% in 2008, and the median share over 2005 to 2025 was 2.2%.",
  "The biggest drop between consecutive years was from 24.5% in 2009 to 7.9% in 2010.",
  "The share in 2024 was 0.6%, slightly lower than in 2025.",
  "These values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes."
 ],
